## 3. Característiques dels dispositius

### Cisco Catalyst 4948
- Consum: 100-150W  
- Format: Rack 19”  
- Ports: 48x RJ45 Gigabit + uplinks SFP+/10Gb  
- Velocitat: 1Gbps (accés), 10Gbps (uplinks)  
- PoE: No (model base)  
- Auto-MDIX: Sí  
- Duplex: Half i Full Duplex  
- Interfícies: RJ45 i SFP+  
- Port Mirroring: Sí  
- Link Aggregation: Sí (LACP)  
- Spanning Tree: STP, RSTP  
- Processament: Store-and-forward  
- Taula CAM: Alta capacitat (entorn empresarial)  
- Capa 3: Sí (routing inter-VLAN)  

### D-Link DES-3526
- Consum: ~40W  
- Format: Rack 19”  
- Ports: 24x Fast Ethernet + uplinks Gigabit  
- Velocitat: 100Mbps (accés), 1Gbps uplinks  
- PoE: No  
- Auto-MDIX: Sí  
- Duplex: Half i Full Duplex  
- Interfícies: RJ45 i SFP  
- Port Mirroring: Sí  
- Link Aggregation: Sí  
- Spanning Tree: STP, RSTP  
- Processament: Store-and-forward  
- Taula CAM: Mitjana  
- Capa 3: No (principalment capa 2)  

### TP-Link TL-SG2216
- Consum: 10-20W  
- Format: Sobremesa / Rack  
- Ports: 16x Gigabit RJ45 + SFP  
- Velocitat: 1Gbps  
- PoE: No (en aquest model)  
- Auto-MDIX: Sí  
- Duplex: Full Duplex  
- Interfícies: RJ45 i SFP  
- Port Mirroring: Sí  
- Link Aggregation: Sí (LACP)  
- Spanning Tree: STP, RSTP  
- Processament: Store-and-forward  
- Taula CAM: Limitada  
- Capa 3: No (Smart Switch)  

### TP-Link TL-SG2008
- Consum: ~10W  
- Format: Sobremesa  
- Ports: 8x Gigabit RJ45  
- Velocitat: 1Gbps  
- PoE: No  
- Auto-MDIX: Sí  
- Duplex: Full Duplex  
- Interfícies: RJ45  
- Port Mirroring: Sí  
- Link Aggregation: Sí  
- Spanning Tree: STP  
- Processament: Store-and-forward  
- Taula CAM: Limitada  
- Capa 3: No  

### MikroTik hAP Series
- Consum: 5-10W  
- Format: Sobremesa  
- Ports: 4-5 RJ45 segons model  
- Velocitat: 100Mbps / 1Gbps segons model  
- PoE: Alguns models sí (PoE in/out)  
- Auto-MDIX: Sí  
- Duplex: Full Duplex  
- Interfícies: RJ45 + WiFi  
- Port Mirroring: Limitat  
- Link Aggregation: No habitual  
- Spanning Tree: Sí  
- Processament: Store-and-forward  
- Taula CAM: Limitada  
- Capa 3: Sí (routing complet, NAT, firewall)  

